IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FUNCDEMO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW.
    COMPUTE WS-X = FUNCTION NUMVAL-C(WS-A).
    COMPUTE WS-Y = FUNCTION MAX(WS-A WS-B WS-C) + 1.
    MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(WS-NAME)(1:1) TO WS-INITIAL.
    COMPUTE WS-Z = FUNCTION MEAN(FUNCTION MAX(WS-A WS-B) WS-C).
    DISPLAY FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE(1:8).
    STOP RUN.
